### Mobile App Authentication Test

# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Test Login - Should work now with increased rate limits
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marco@italiandelight.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "businessSlug": "italian-delight"
}

### 2. Test Login with businessId instead of businessSlug
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marco@italiandelight.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "businessId": 1
}

### 3. Test Floor Plan Access (after login)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "marco@italiandelight.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "businessSlug": "italian-delight"
}

### Get floor plans with tables
GET {{baseUrl}}/floor-plans
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### Get specific floor plan with tables
GET {{baseUrl}}/floor-plans/1/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 4. Test Tables Access
GET {{baseUrl}}/tables
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

